[[Thor's Hammer]] is an [[Engineer]] item normally obtained by catalytically crafting a [[Hammer]] with the [[Mana Crystal]], which is an [[Engineer]] subclass item. It is a straight upgrade of the [[Hammer]], with higher accuracy, more sockets, and an additional {{icon/mana}} consuming ability which deals {{icon/effect}}-damage and inflicts temporary {{icon/blind}}.

[[Thor's Hammer]] is one of the four required items to craft the [[Automanaton]], along with the [[Magitecc Armor]], [[Cap of Brilliance]], and [[Arcane Boots]], all of which are obtained by catalytically crafting shop items with the [[Mana Crystal]].
